          "returns": "string",
          "params": [],
          "body": {
            "lit": "When one of your effects trashes this card in your hand, if it\u0027s your turn, 1 of your Digimon may digivolve into 1 purple Digimon card with [Undead] or [Dark Animal] in its traits from your trash for its digivolution cost."
          }
        },
        {
